Refuse: box rad 8px wid 1.15 ht 0.5 "Refused here"
S1: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "1 Inspect" at Refuse + (-1.3, -1.0)
S2: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "2 Select" at S1 + (1.3, 0)
S3: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "3 Negotiate" at S2 + (1.3, 0)
S4: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "4 Snapshot" at S3 + (1.3, 0)
S5: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "5 Evaluate" at S4 + (1.3, 0)
S6: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "6 Resolve" at S1 + (0, -1.15)
S7: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "7 Validate" at S6 + (1.3, 0)
S8: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "8 Produce" at S7 + (1.3, 0)
S9: box rad 8px wid 1.1 ht 0.62 "9 Return" at S8 + (1.3, 0)
arrow from S1.e to S2.w
arrow from S2.e to S3.w
arrow from S3.e to S4.w
arrow from S4.e to S5.w
arrow from S6.e to S7.w
arrow from S7.e to S8.w
